@FeedbackApi_HostAddress = http://localhost:5285

### Submit feedback with "like" reaction
POST {{FeedbackApi_HostAddress}}/api/feedback
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reaction": "like",
  "feedback": "{\"feedbackText\":\"This is a good response!\"}"
}

###

### Submit feedback with "dislike" reaction
POST {{FeedbackApi_HostAddress}}/api/feedback
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reaction": "dislike",
  "feedback": "{\"feedbackText\":\"This response needs improvement.\"}"
}

###

### Get all feedback
GET {{FeedbackApi_HostAddress}}/api/feedback
Accept: application/json

###

### Get feedback by ID (replace {id} with actual ID)
GET {{FeedbackApi_HostAddress}}/api/feedback/1
Accept: application/json

###
